Modifications
-------------

This is an unofficial fork. In accordance with section 5(a) of the GNU Affero
General Public License, the following changes to the original work are
recorded here.

Modified by Simeon Vutov, 2026:

  - Added Qt localization infrastructure: locale detection that follows the
    QGIS language, translator loading with a safe fallback to Dutch, and
    build targets for extracting and compiling translations.
  - Separated technical identifiers from display labels throughout the layer
    catalogue handling.
  - Internationalized the plugin's own user interface, including the Qt
    Designer dialog, the Processing algorithms and the locator filter, and
    added a complete English translation.
  - Fixed the translation context used by the Processing algorithms, which
    previously prevented their translations from loading at all.
  - Added a language switch that re-translates the running plugin without
    restarting QGIS.
  - Added curated English names for PDOK services and layers, presented
    alongside the original Dutch names, with bilingual catalogue search.
  - Added a test suite and localization documentation.

